title: Print Spooler Port Monitor DLL Persistence
id: 58421991-f0be-4b4f-ae5b-0fe710214b6e
status: experimental
description: Detects port monitor DLL persistence.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1547/010/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: registry_set
detection:
  selection:
    TargetObject|contains: '\Control\Print\Monitors\'
    TargetObject|endswith: '\Driver'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - TargetObject
  - Details
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Printer driver installation registering legitimate monitors
level: high
tags:
  - attack.persistence
  - attack.privilege_escalation
  - attack.t1547.010
